<div class="snp">
  <div class="snp__head">
    <p class="snp__eyebrow">Terms and policies</p>
    <h2 class="snp__title">Payment</h2>
    <p class="snp__lead">Pay the way you usually do – secure, encrypted and with no fees.</p>
    <p class="snp__date">Last updated October 7, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__facts">
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">$0</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">in payment fees</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">Encrypted</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">payment</span></div>
    <div class="snp__fact"><span class="snp__fact-val">CAD</span><span class="snp__fact-lbl">prices in Canadian dollars</span></div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">01</span>Payment methods</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>We accept cards such as Visa and Mastercard. At checkout you'll always see every payment method available to you – depending on your device, that may also include Apple Pay or Google Pay.</p>
      <p>There are no fees, whichever method you use.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">02</span>When is the amount charged?</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>The amount is authorized or charged when you place your order. If an item sells out, or you cancel the order before it ships, we release the authorization or refund the amount in full.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">03</span>Security</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <ul>
        <li>Payment is made over an encrypted connection (SSL) with our payment providers.</li>
        <li>We never see or store your card details.</li>
        <li>Card payments may be verified with 3-D Secure – usually in your banking app – so no one else can use your card.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">04</span>Prices, taxes and currency</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>All prices and payments are in Canadian dollars (CAD). Any applicable sales taxes (GST/HST/PST) are calculated and shown at checkout, and the total at checkout is your final price – no fees or duties are added afterwards. Shipping is free, and the multi-buy discount is applied automatically in the cart. If you pay with a card issued outside Canada, your bank may charge a currency conversion fee – that's outside our control.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">05</span>Receipt</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>The order confirmation you receive by email is your receipt. It shows the items, prices, discount and taxes. If it's missing, check your spam folder or write to us and we'll send it again.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">06</span>Refunds</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>Refunds always go back to the payment method you used – no later than 14 days after we receive your return or proof that you've sent it. Your bank usually takes another 3–5 business days to show the amount. Read more in our <a href="/pages/retur-og-refusionspolitik">returns and refunds policy</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__sec">
    <h3><span class="snp__num">07</span>Payment problems</h3>
    <div class="snp__body">
      <p>If your payment is declined, check your card's expiry date and spending limit, or try another payment method. If you've been charged but haven't received an order confirmation, write to us with your name and address – we'll find the order and make sure you don't pay twice.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__help">
    <p class="snp__help-title">Questions about payment?</p>
    <p>Write to us – a real person will reply.</p>
    <a class="snp__btn" href="mailto:support@daltonpierce.com">Email customer service</a>
    <p class="snp__help-meta">support@daltonpierce.com · Mon–Fri 9:00–18:00 CET · reply within 1–2 business days</p>
  </div>

  <div class="snp__more">
    <p class="snp__more-title">Terms and policies</p>
    <div class="snp__more-links">
      <a href="/pages/vilkar-og-betingelser">Terms of service</a>
      <a href="/pages/retur-og-refusionspolitik">Returns and refunds</a>
      <a href="/pages/forsendelsespolitik">Shipping and delivery</a>
      <a class="snp__cur" href="/pages/payment-policy">Payment</a>
      <a href="/pages/betalingspolitik">Privacy policy</a>
      <a href="/pages/contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
